        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We currently rely and expect to continue to rely on third-party contract manufacturer organizations (\"CMOs\") for the manufacture of our product candidates for preclinical and clinical testing, as well as for commercial production of any product candidates that are approved.",
